### 1. Create a new asset (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Túnica de Nazareno - Talla L",
  "category": "Tunic",
  "status": "Available"
}

### 2. Get all assets (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a new member (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Antonio",
  "lastName": "García",
  "nationalId": "12345678A",
  "memberNumber": 150
}

### 4. Find member by National ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/dni/12345678A
Accept: application/json

### 5. Assign Asset 1 to Member 1 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/1/assign/1
Accept: application/json